 n←{x}(fns ∆Ask)question;n;buffer;globalParms;parms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Non-modal cover for `CreateRequest`; used by test cases.
 :Access Public Shared
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '(0⊃⎕DM )⎕signal 999')(0 'N')
 x←{(0<⎕NC ⍵):⍎⍵ ⋄ ⍬}'x'
 (globalParms parms)←fns #._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiUtils.GetParms x
 parms.(onHelp onOkay)←'"Help"' '"Okay"'#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CheckUserCallback¨parms.(onHelp onOkay)
 :If ~0∊⍴question
     parms.question←question
 :EndIf
 n←globalParms #._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateRequest parms
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.PolishRequest n
 n.Btn1.onSelect←1 ⍝ Enable the "Cancel" button
 ⎕NQ n.Input'GotFocus'
